{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world's first half-human hybrid, you know that you're not something that's supposed to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, here you are. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An outcast in a world that's not your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in a feud between yourself and your encroaching distorted view of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To you, things have always been black and white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've accepted your worth on this planet, and have accepted whatever torment the next day may bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've accepted that you belong in captivity, locked away from the world, and have always been nothing more than some science project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>However, one day, in a spur-of-the-moment impulse...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>...your entire life will change.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat with quick-time based mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original atmospheric soundtrack\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles that unlock special moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of both reality and the mindscape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not a game for kids.</strong> Disturbing and unsettling topics and imagery will be prevelent.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2472260?t=1760739908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass